    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb95c1bddf87ab4531d8270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的可爱\r\n在接下来的一年又要更新了……\r\n姐姐，你不可以眨眼哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1eae28cf52a796f1cf235425e1773056df4dffa2b0752885c683005a3953d23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5cbd02e111d238b8eea744a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，有公告诶！\r\n喂喂喂，内容是什么？\r\n机伶也想知道♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda9d7ca379169fd8c0ec9706e5694d4643f3abdf1ad2992e8a6a10fa89d0c7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8486f5193af355045bb28b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物诶！\r\n姐姐真受欢迎。\r\n机伶可能都要吃醋了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fa28c61a920bd54d43b12846247aa53c7df80bf33b3201ec20ff98efe621d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:117fba459c568a5716969aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害，你达成目标了！\r\n不愧是机伶的姐姐♪",
