      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6767a72d9b8a628e96726bbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿搭有许多规矩，但我现在重视的\r\n应该是平衡吧。比方说，像和姐姐\r\n站在一起时的……之类的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "087d5ef9dd03f45b74353c46501c933267603002bd1d3d12f51332f498f31fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10126"
