    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1b3ba8e3718d86a7467f330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行不行，一脸疲惫\r\n就不像机伶了……\r\n可是……呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f66ec61f0a5fec1e6c8aaad813733b0925ff07e827ebdadd82fc619cf757b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6059a736dcd14767034a2c47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坦白说，机伶累坏了。\r\n我觉得这次先休息，等下次再努力，\r\n动力和效率都会比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73abbd551b29cb72734c4e6c2322a22a37a7cf3b152ba6bcaee715fb17073801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d79bd96279c44deaebcd6bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的机伶感觉很棒！\r\n似乎可以展现出超乎预期的可爱呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d3161e9347f30035e8de66cc14756c6e2bef5902ef3e1e9c6176716634caef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ac1f94b23a5efb1adb8e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉飘飘然的，双脚好轻盈，\r\n好像可以飞到任何地方去……\r\n这就是状况绝佳吗？啊哈，好舒畅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71da6367d013c80a0a4fdfd51e31bbe5efabb1e78efd44e1516d91f8f8c19eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd18ae57c8fbdd31e84352bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥在看我！\r\n机伶会加油的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45e00210719557bba43f66257f6bd12e05c75a876c37b12f6c5cdd657caeadb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e07d5000d8941e480c9f3a15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要好好关注机伶，\r\n别让我太拼命咯☆",
