      "source_text": "嗯……真的要今天做吗？\r\n我有一种拿不出\r\n什么好结果的预感～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb9ed983dbd1d43644351d8af5ffc67cfdce1299a6f5113702b4c254544e6a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60cbacbe5454d29c98621015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要把行程塞太满哦。\r\n那样很累又不可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a71f40f8f85bb8d8481179f37cb0ba41ea5f63054e084e6fb684d2df66c4c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7373f42c14d3aae3ad6e9904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，发梢分岔。\r\n到看得出来的程度，\r\n感觉已经完蛋了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17cb6a413cc38853d8f9a370bf8f4e8024d7489df4ca7e203ddf0e118d93717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb0cf6c28b444a62692a951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥要说什么我全都知道。\r\n但机伶也是赛马娘，\r\n总会有办不到的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caacc4f430572f72f22f4863dc94e30b45a3f7475fcedd57fb4b97f902ade1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41a659bf6aef8a616db911e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦～又要比赛？\r\n噗，哥哥真坏心眼。\r\n……之后要给我奖励哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37cee975de91214414e56e91269f317bcf5224296f7daf59c567c38562cb393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af35cc1da39721564194daf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哥哥，机伶的身心状况\r\n确实都管理得滴水不漏。\r\n可是……你做得太过火了！啪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "521bff665a545ee7fe6f96de42dd0527867f3b3bee649a3512dced3b6c773bea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8a4eaa73ccd125b71d6ae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，心情好极了！\r\n接着只差哥哥一句「可爱」，\r\n准备的部分就完美无缺了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e34eb06df02cc85529e92948f7b98c88b6464e0e64cf549f50531c20d7f6f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f045675089309673dd4b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，决定了♪今天的欢呼声\r\n全都是属于机伶的！\r\n我去迷倒大家咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a86e4d2dcdb76fe8b0f49df64b9f90e1966224aac5c36ecc31f9575c5f06c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ded11e3c8fe7325a001fee2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "计划与模拟都万无一失，\r\n接着只剩机伶下场跑步……呵呵♪\r\n除了获胜之外，我想不到其他可能呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8998ebeba0d88e26299af77e9f07cab210304580877fa12251cadc9225ed0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6616d2a8c1b32b39b0d09782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，听我说听我说！\r\n机伶……状况可能挺不错的♪\r\n你可以有所期待哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1771cb2bca66a529d89df91ceabd78637f0e744511dae97d0cd999148ff4002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1cf04bb01309a275745753c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#今天要比赛\r\n#奔驰起来有如娇柔的花朵\r\n#期待大家替我加油哦♪』",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45e0f093bb5f25ec934b22e0d4d252074f22d6663dfbb929c02e827ac10bb9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89df8d9a0b282f901e522f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得……自己应该赢得了，\r\n实际上输掉就不可爱了嘛。\r\n好啦好啦，我们来讨论策略吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c90e5f20463f337e0db8b9832fca674bf44dade77a5a30a55b3b816569756bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192bad1765e918b529f08552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了大家的笑容，\r\n机伶会加油的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecbf2e5eb26c6780e07622fd7a57d18a55d922441855c4167e4b76f53f65f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0ca1a1f4381595192989d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要多拍一点照片哦。\r\n我会像平常那样\r\n跑得很可爱的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7601f8ce3ab5f369532b11843d2d3d310df6fc9026c7aee45b8b87968a3af338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f2295593e1620a319b3f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为会有很多人聚集，\r\n我很喜欢比赛哦♪\r\n好，得来自我推销咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91baa033190fdec00ebc13de33bcb446be549e5c98a010d0caa9907d6fed90a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ddeadd74f74bd3f8cabd06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……嗯？\r\n嘿嘿嘿，机伶没事哦！\r\n只是做了个深呼吸而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e353d96ad2aec77256d78cbb3e4b60897283fbd0bd37ad4e408f3074e1d7ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9670773c12989f8c18971a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该先向神明祈祷才对～\r\n机伶的魅力可以让运气\r\n确实站在自己这边的来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ba0729ef2d27497497c5d94ff9d84ca7326080b8fdc39765f90220cfa25fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09d38ebeeb773a02cf2f2ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……机伶也猜不到\r\n情况会怎么发展，\r\n或许出乎意料地没问题吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e1333d30ac2017baeefc1016201b548e04a2b796d6d3745c7b37b653ee183f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836d462b0581679f5a4c93f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不要紧，机伶办得到。\r\n不管是哥哥或大家……\r\n应该都是这么相信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fd1ada65d1a537d18feb396e78c60dedcaf219d9d7dbd6c6be94302f572fd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4d258b91b33cb0e71a78c4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说呀，机伶真的很……\r\n不，没事。\r\n那我去努力了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd258f5b1aa3d63b56aaea4310e14e61d1b9a4516d8e59e15c8e2c39e83e994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3596b897f1d05d039dbfe0fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况不怎么样，也没有确切证据……\r\n要是这样都还能赢，就证明\r\n机伶是最可爱的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "394f52f77bab94e7e9c7228d85661abeac3d85f3c332aa7a3e5cdbe08c34880c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eecfd1d012d1016a58dd73cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1e04ca0fa6cabf572aaedefcfd9e13cbbafaadb54df1396aaf088b0b4eafbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa883d168f0cae06c2bf4c15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90af28f2ecca29713f4644963bc961130c5734bb677280a8b189a2f2dfd5fb66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e136ec4c3fca45d4425336b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "120cb05b0c8935f37e152f6265768395488958648429fd52fdaff3e28a181c71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2647929a81eb3cc83c5eb1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既可爱又聪明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27367d33ae6969f8cc2649601a9fb4f3b5a78071ef8c2c1e426385d7ec829277",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b09883ab6839d60b2f4556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab4d13c8690c5b773c7e8d0f308ac06b5ea6d60ebd513c72f9d534551469d26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e17aaaa13c1983a219ce5d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结～束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb89ad760bfb867294639cdb99834a0e96e72225a721ac2966d7c9d47bf7afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a325ebdd7314e8db80a533d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享受这场约会吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "174d015c2ece012b26edf26392bf18fc344731d59d4f398dd26da90db584f4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11659912144e9874c24472b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8d40168f14c56df80a24f1e9db7f053d3a1ff10ed6b48687aae8404647163f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c26c8fcc98e0b4d5cc501565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69057567c363a194325466d557d5388101a87045276bc82da0cc8733dff9f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27eaf5aac988ae49a1d82d81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很努力了，哥哥♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f422acd815595850fcd5ee13e006a542a73989a6f2494035f7b8f3f991182a79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e36568abca118c59f7ececb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望你陪陪我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c0ae6cbbe0ec4a43c621dca7e988c0d9526a34d66427ab57e0ce78080a5e0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94425a45e294be896fac3890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐在看我！\r\n机伶会加油的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82342d19b3d824e6756af0b352684dea39b638e2f8f15069489b54d92e1c1bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20104"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
